{"id":"41d5b79d11297576","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-np-completeness.md","title":"NP-Complete Language","display":"df-np-complete-language — NP-Complete Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","aliases":["73-df-binary-np-completeness","73-df-np-complete-language"],"display":"df-np-complete-language — NP-Complete Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-np]]","[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-np-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-np-completeness</span><span>73-df-np-complete-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-np-complete-language — NP-Complete Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> (NP language class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m^p\">\\(\\leq_m^p\\)</span> (polynomial-time many-one reducibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NPComplete}(L)\\leftrightarrow\nL\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\;(A\\leq_m^p L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NPComplete}(L)\\leftrightarrow\nL\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\;(A\\leq_m^p L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPC}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathsf{NP}:\\operatorname{NPComplete}(L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NPC}\\coloneqq\\{L\\in\\mathsf{NP}:\\operatorname{NPComplete}(L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> and NP-hardness are separate conjuncts; an arbitrary hard language outside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> is not called NP-complete.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved",